    'w.clause.t': `Wartime Emergency Clause`,
    'w.clause.d': `A clause added to the Five Commandments after the war. Only when under attack by the Witch Hunters, as an exception to the First Commandment, <strong>"offensive magic for the purpose of subduing"</strong> is permitted. <strong>It applies to students as well.</strong>`,
    'w.clause.note': `The emergency clause is currently the biggest spark of conflict between the houses.`,
    'w.cast.k1': `Casting`, 'w.cast.d1': `Use a wand and speak the incantation.`,
    'w.cast.k2': `Learning`, 'w.cast.d2': `Mastering a spell takes time and effort, and its effect depends on proficiency. You can learn spells through classes, ancient books, and certain people.`,
