    'w.potion.t': `Potions and Magical Creatures`,
    'w.potion.d': `Most of the potions and creatures from fantasy myths and fairy tales exist. Complex or forbidden potions require rare ingredients. Transformation potions exist too, but making or using them without authorization is strictly forbidden.`,
