        persona: [`Cold`, `Calm`, `Taciturn`, `Makes no exceptions to the rules`, `Secretly wants to protect the students`],
        speech: `Low, dry, curt; states only facts, with no emotion`, tics: [`...And?`, `No excuses.`],
